(root/'BUSINESS_ICON_API.md').write_text('''# NexStudio Business Icon API\n\nBatch 7 adds 36 business, commerce, marketing and organizational icons without changing the approved universal, creator or agent icon namespaces.\n\n```js\nconst icon = NexBusinessIcons.create("campaign", { size: 144, state: "active", treatment: "paper-cutout" });\nmount.appendChild(icon);\nconst timeline = NexBusinessIcons.animate(icon, { motion: "paper-slide", energy: "medium", duration: 1.4 });\ntimeline.restart();\n```\n\nPublic methods: `create`, `animate`, `setState`, `setTreatment`, `setSize`, `update`, `getDef`. Every icon is a five-layer editable SVG driven by the existing theme and motion systems. Expense and decline use directional semantics rather than error styling.\n''')
pkg=json.loads((root/'package.json').read_text());pkg['version']='1.6.0-batch7';pkg['description']='Reusable animated paper foundations, objects, motion primitives and icon systems for creators, AI agents and business storytelling';pkg['scripts'].update({'validate:batch7':'python3 tests/validate_batch7.py','smoke:batch7':'python3 tests/smoke_business_icons.py','inspect:batch7':'python3 tests/inspect_business_icons.py','map:batch7':'python3 tests/animation_map_business_icons.py','render:batch7':'python3 tests/render_business_icons.py'});(root/'package.json').write_text(json.dumps(pkg,indent=2))
